/* ========================================
 * GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT DIRECTLY
 * ========================================
 * Screen/modal CSS (app-CSS tier), lifted from Python sources -- scoped selectors
 *
 * Generated by tldw_chatbook/css/build_css.py from the class-level
 * BUNDLED_CSS/BUNDLED_SCREEN_CSS declarations in the Python sources.
 * Edit those declarations, then re-run build_css.py.
